    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think \"support\" changes the math of it. it's just a fact that i'm the one who walked away and they didn't. it feels like there's this debt i owe to the universe, or to them, and no amount of \"finding support\" is ever going to balance the scales. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable, like i'm holding onto something that isn't mine anymore.",
